WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.262
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.532 --> 00:08.568
(Sword & Silence)

3
00:37.264 --> 00:41.067
(Sword & Silence)

4
00:41.768 --> 00:43.036
(This drama merged facts with fiction and plots may differ from records.)

5
00:43.103 --> 00:44.304
(Children and animals were filmed with the aid of guardians and experts.)

6
00:44.371 --> 00:45.705
(Some scenes were made using generative AI.)

7
00:49.276 --> 00:52.746
In this land, Goguryeo, Baekje, and Silla...

8
00:53.346 --> 00:55.549
fought fiercely for hundreds of years.

9
00:56.516 --> 01:01.354
Even Tang, having unified the continent, eyed this land.

10
01:01.421 --> 01:06.326
In 642, Silla was cornered by threats from Baekje and Goguryeo.

11
01:07.327 --> 01:11.598
And internally, the Jingol nobles fought over the throne.

12
01:12.966 --> 01:16.536
There were enemies...

13
01:16.636 --> 01:17.904
both outside and within.

14
01:21.975 --> 01:24.344
(Seorabeol, Silla, Year 642)

15
01:47.834 --> 01:49.302
Are you blaming the wind again?

16
01:49.903 --> 01:51.538
I am reading the wind, Beop Min.

17
01:51.605 --> 01:52.606
What?

18
01:53.239 --> 01:55.308
- You are reading the wind? - Beop Min.

19
01:55.675 --> 01:57.310
(Kim In Mun, Kim Chun Chu's second son)

20
01:57.377 --> 02:02.682
They say an arrow flies straight when shot to save, rather than to kill.

21
02:07.354 --> 02:08.355
Save what?

22
02:14.728 --> 02:15.729
The nation.

23
02:19.299 --> 02:21.201
It is a hit.

24
02:21.968 --> 02:24.070
It is a hit.

25
02:57.771 --> 02:59.506
It is a miss.

26
03:00.640 --> 03:02.142
It is a miss.

27
03:03.810 --> 03:06.680
What use is a well-aimed arrow in saving a dying nation?

28
03:07.814 --> 03:09.315
There you go again.

29
03:10.150 --> 03:12.385
If you are not confident in your skills, just say so.

30
03:12.719 --> 03:15.355
Anyway, a promise is a promise, so that bow is mine now.

31
03:16.756 --> 03:19.793
How can I beat you when you can read the wind?

32
03:20.694 --> 03:23.530
That is the bow of Kim In Mun, the Divine Archer of the Wind.

33
03:23.596 --> 03:24.597
Let me try it out.

34
03:25.732 --> 03:28.401
There he goes again. Beop Min!

35
03:28.768 --> 03:30.503
(Baekje)

36
03:40.380 --> 03:42.949
(Kim Chun Chu, Silla's Minister of Military Affairs)

37
04:08.241 --> 04:10.176
Beop Min, how far are you going?

38
05:32.725 --> 05:33.726
Baek Ryong.

39
05:35.428 --> 05:36.496
Chun Chu.

40
05:37.931 --> 05:39.132
What are you all doing?

41
05:39.199 --> 05:41.768
Call a physician immediately! We must save the general!

42
05:41.835 --> 05:42.836
- Yes, sir. - Yes, sir.

43
05:55.281 --> 05:57.016
Please help me!

44
05:57.584 --> 05:58.852
We must stop the plague!

45
05:59.118 --> 06:01.554
I order you to burn all the bodies!

46
06:09.495 --> 06:10.496
Move!

47
06:11.197 --> 06:12.265
Did we lose to Baekje again?

48
06:15.969 --> 06:16.970
Kill him!

49
06:23.476 --> 06:24.477
Just kill him!

50
06:35.688 --> 06:39.158
Those Baekje bastards took the fortresses and slaughtered everyone.

51
06:40.960 --> 06:42.562
But there were so many fortresses.

52
06:44.163 --> 06:45.498
What about Daeyaseong?

53
06:47.734 --> 06:49.168
Daeyaseong is the only remaining fortress.

54
06:51.704 --> 06:52.872
Kim Pum Seok, that bastard...

55
07:06.085 --> 07:08.221
How dare you abandon the nation and flee?

56
07:08.288 --> 07:10.924
- You cowards! - Die!

57
07:12.959 --> 07:13.960
Let us kill him!

58
07:14.661 --> 07:15.762
End his life!

59
07:18.898 --> 07:23.636
We fought as hard as we could!

60
07:24.671 --> 07:27.573
The generals sent us to our deaths.

61
07:28.808 --> 07:32.111
Could you have held out?

62
07:32.178 --> 07:35.114
This is unjust!

63
07:35.181 --> 07:39.152
Silla does not forgive those who retreat from battle.

64
07:39.619 --> 07:40.687
Behead him.

65
07:40.987 --> 07:41.988
Yes, sir.

66
07:58.571 --> 08:01.874
We will die anyway if we retreat.

67
08:01.941 --> 08:03.943
From Goguryeo, Baekje, even Japan,

68
08:05.611 --> 08:07.246
we have nowhere left to flee.

69
08:11.351 --> 08:12.352
It is hell.

70
08:16.990 --> 08:19.192
No. Do not do this.

71
08:19.258 --> 08:22.762
- My dear. - Please...

72
08:22.829 --> 08:24.497
Please show mercy.

73
08:24.564 --> 08:27.633
Please show mercy this once.

74
08:27.700 --> 08:29.769
Please forgive him. I beg you.

75
08:29.836 --> 08:31.104
Please do not kill him.

76
08:33.039 --> 08:37.110
Please show mercy this once.

77
08:37.176 --> 08:38.711
Please save him.

78
08:40.646 --> 08:43.049
Please show mercy this once.

79
08:59.866 --> 09:01.868
Why did you not light the beacon?

80
09:02.402 --> 09:03.503
And what happened to Kim Pum Seok?

81
09:03.903 --> 09:05.938
We were ambushed before we could even raise the signal fire.

82
09:06.572 --> 09:09.342
There must be people in the fortress who are in league with Baekje.

83
09:10.143 --> 09:11.144
It was the damn Gaya.

84
09:12.278 --> 09:14.113
There must have been Gaya people inside the fortress.

85
09:15.815 --> 09:18.818
That is a dangerous thing to say. Do not jump to conclusions.

86
09:19.986 --> 09:21.054
Is it not obvious?

87
09:21.421 --> 09:24.457
Sokhamseong Fortress is located on land that once belonged to Gaya.

88
09:24.791 --> 09:28.161
Even the soldiers guarding the gates were all of Gaya descent.

89
09:29.328 --> 09:32.265
The beacon was never lit, the fortress gates were opened,

90
09:32.999 --> 09:34.734
and Kim Pum Seok sent no reinforcements.

91
09:35.368 --> 09:37.236
It was all the work of those Gaya people.

92
09:42.975 --> 09:44.644
Did you really witness them betraying us?

93
09:44.710 --> 09:48.247
What proof do I need? They are a people who will betray us at any time.

94
09:50.349 --> 09:51.818
I must report this to Her Majesty immediately.

95
09:54.787 --> 09:55.788
Baek Ryong.

96
09:57.457 --> 09:58.891
Why did you come to me?

97
10:01.794 --> 10:05.765
Who cares more for Silla than you, Kim Chun Chu?

98
10:07.400 --> 10:08.501
I knew I could trust you.

99
10:32.592 --> 10:33.593
You...

100
10:35.161 --> 10:36.162
It could not be...

101
11:01.454 --> 11:05.391
(Episode 1 Crossed Fates)

102
11:06.392 --> 11:08.895
(Wolseong Palace, Seorabeol, Silla)

103
11:19.138 --> 11:20.907
Her Majesty is entering.

104
11:33.152 --> 11:35.454
(Kim Jin Ju, Silla's minister, a Jingol)

105
11:35.521 --> 11:37.790
(Yeom Jong, Silla's minister, a Jingol)

106
11:37.857 --> 11:40.293
(Bi Dam, Silla's minister, a Jingol)

107
12:00.813 --> 12:03.349
(Queen Seondeok, 27th ruler of Silla)

108
12:03.950 --> 12:06.152
Where is General Baek Ryong?

109
12:06.219 --> 12:07.453
He is currently ill in bed.

110
12:15.962 --> 12:19.065
He is ill?

111
12:19.799 --> 12:23.269
At times like this, he should be rallying his strength.

112
12:24.170 --> 12:27.974
We lost 40 fortresses to Baekje, and the nation is on the verge of ruin.

113
12:28.474 --> 12:31.677
Yet he uses illness as an excuse?

114
12:33.946 --> 12:37.583
The general is only human. He, too, can fall ill.

115
12:38.417 --> 12:44.790
I wonder if he is truly ill or plotting some other scheme.

116
12:46.659 --> 12:52.431
Countless people have lost their families and are in greater pain than he is.

117
12:52.498 --> 12:53.899
That is enough.

118
12:55.735 --> 12:58.704
If only General Kim Yu Sin were here in Seorabeol,

119
12:59.872 --> 13:02.108
I would not be so anxious about the state of affairs.

120
13:05.244 --> 13:10.983
The general has served at the border for three years without relief.

121
13:11.217 --> 13:13.519
Why not use this opportunity to summon him?

122
13:13.586 --> 13:15.788
How can we leave the Goguryeo border unattended, Your Majesty?

123
13:16.322 --> 13:20.993
I heard King Ko Geon Mu of Goguryeo is currently...

124
13:21.661 --> 13:23.829
avoiding war to focus all his efforts on internal affairs.

125
13:25.231 --> 13:26.866
That is merely a rumor, Your Majesty.

126
13:27.500 --> 13:30.469
We must not assume that Goguryeo will not attack us.

127
13:31.537 --> 13:34.907
If Goguryeo marches from the north, it will truly be the end of us.

128
13:48.621 --> 13:54.393
I intend to offer prayers to the Buddha for Silla.

129
13:56.329 --> 13:58.998
Your Majesty, please preserve your health.

130
14:10.743 --> 14:13.446
Must she go on about Buddha?

131
14:23.923 --> 14:25.024
Lord Bi Dam.

132
14:26.959 --> 14:29.695
It seems things are unfolding just as you predicted.

133
14:30.262 --> 14:31.297
What is it?

134
14:31.364 --> 14:35.534
There is a rumor circulating that Baek Ryong went to see Kim Chun Chu.

135
14:35.601 --> 14:38.371
You mean General Baek Ryong of Sokhamseong Fortress? What of it?

136
14:38.771 --> 14:41.173
No one has seen him since then.

137
14:41.974 --> 14:46.045
He went in but never came out. Does that not mean he is dead?

138
14:47.613 --> 14:50.716
If Baek Ryong were dead, Chun Chu would be in an uproar.

139
14:51.317 --> 14:54.487
Chun Chu and Baek Ryong are the closest among us.

140
14:54.553 --> 14:55.621
They are childhood friends.

141
14:55.688 --> 14:58.924
And you are saying Chun Chu hid his death?

142
14:59.992 --> 15:01.193
Why?

143
15:01.260 --> 15:04.296
Baek Ryong is not someone who would ever leave his post.

144
15:04.697 --> 15:07.533
Yet he abandoned the fortress and went to see Chun Chu.

145
15:09.535 --> 15:11.937
That means he discovered something important.

146
15:12.204 --> 15:16.409
General Baek Ryong hated the Gaya people.

147
15:17.276 --> 15:19.779
If he went as far as to risk a retreat,

148
15:20.679 --> 15:23.315
he must have found something that could destroy Gaya.

149
15:24.250 --> 15:26.419
There are already many rumors in Seorabeol.

150
15:26.685 --> 15:29.155
They say the Gaya people were colluding with Baekje,

151
15:29.555 --> 15:30.990
and Baek Ryong tried to report it.

152
15:38.998 --> 15:44.003
So he must have tried to report it, but died at the hands of Chun Chu instead.

153
15:47.840 --> 15:48.841
But why?

154
15:49.375 --> 15:53.279
Because the wife of Chun Chu is the sister of General Kim Yu Sin, a Gaya man.

155
15:53.779 --> 15:57.183
That means their children also carry Gaya blood.

156
15:57.817 --> 16:03.088
So you are saying Chun Chu killed Baek Ryong to protect his family?

157
16:03.155 --> 16:04.457
The great Kim Chun Chu?

158
16:08.561 --> 16:11.130
You should leave politics and go write plays instead.

159
16:11.197 --> 16:13.499
Good grief, you fools.

160
16:14.700 --> 16:15.701
Jin Ju.

161
16:17.303 --> 16:18.737
You are a genius, you know.

162
16:19.438 --> 16:20.506
Did you just realize that?

163
16:22.475 --> 16:25.311
Then we must arrest Kim Chun Chu and interrogate him.

164
16:25.945 --> 16:28.314
Is this not a perfect chance to shake up Her Majesty and Chun Chu?

165
16:30.149 --> 16:31.717
The truth is not important.

166
16:32.718 --> 16:35.387
What matters is what the people believe.

167
16:37.223 --> 16:40.226
Just gather many ministers who will fuel this fire.

168
16:41.961 --> 16:46.765
Then that fire will swallow up Kim Chun Chu on its own.

169
16:49.301 --> 16:52.972
Oh, come. Chun Chu would not do that.

170
16:53.038 --> 16:56.141
You are trying to frame a man over a little joke.

171
16:57.610 --> 16:59.011
Whose side are you on?

172
17:05.484 --> 17:08.087
Minister Chun Chu has sent a message to you both.

173
17:17.930 --> 17:19.932
He wants us to watch a play at a time like this?

174
17:24.403 --> 17:25.504
Kim Chun Chu.

175
17:37.983 --> 17:39.485
(Maps and Records)

176
17:42.221 --> 17:44.823
Emperor Li Shimin of Tang has opened the National Academy.

177
17:46.358 --> 17:48.494
The greatest minds are gathering in Tang right now.

178
17:50.329 --> 17:54.800
Learning and networking there will be an invaluable opportunity.

179
17:54.867 --> 17:57.970
Countless corpses are being burned so we could gain a small piece of land.

180
17:59.338 --> 18:00.406
It is as if...

181
18:01.240 --> 18:02.808
they were born only to die.

182
18:04.343 --> 18:05.344
Are you...

183
18:06.745 --> 18:10.416
telling me I should go to Tang so I could escape death?

184
18:11.684 --> 18:13.986
Not everyone needs to go to the battlefield and die.

185
18:14.753 --> 18:16.522
Some must take up the sword.

186
18:16.589 --> 18:19.191
And some must go out into the world...

187
18:19.992 --> 18:22.294
to find a way to save their nation.

188
18:28.167 --> 18:31.804
If you will not go to Tang, then you must go to the battlefield.

189
18:32.705 --> 18:37.009
But you cannot even shoot an arrow. You will fall quickly.

190
18:38.310 --> 18:41.480
I only pity the soldiers who will have to carry away your corpse.

191
18:42.214 --> 18:44.683
Then who cleared away the corpse of General Baek Ryong?

192
18:45.851 --> 18:48.654
Was that also for the country?

193
18:56.428 --> 18:57.529
My decision has been made.

194
19:00.099 --> 19:01.667
I am not going anywhere.

195
19:01.734 --> 19:03.469
Whether it is the battlefield or Tang,

196
19:04.003 --> 19:08.007
I will not be used as a tool by greedy men, only to be thrown away.

197
19:08.941 --> 19:09.942
Beop Min.

198
19:10.342 --> 19:13.178
Baekje and Silla have killed and destroyed each other over and over.

199
19:13.245 --> 19:14.880
Have we not fought this war for 200 years?

200
19:35.300 --> 19:36.301
Listen well.

201
19:39.104 --> 19:43.042
Whether you go to Tang, the battlefield, or neither of those places,

202
19:45.444 --> 19:46.512
you are my son.

203
19:48.247 --> 19:49.548
That will never change.

204
19:56.488 --> 19:58.424
Your thoughts and mine are no different.

205
19:59.591 --> 20:02.528
For it is our fate...

206
20:04.363 --> 20:05.731
to end this vicious cycle of bloodshed.

207
20:16.308 --> 20:20.079
Beop Min, you go to Tang. In Mun, you will go with me.

208
20:20.345 --> 20:21.346
Yes, Father.

209
20:31.023 --> 20:32.024
Beop Min.

210
20:53.846 --> 20:56.215
I lost my husband before our wedding night.

211
20:56.749 --> 20:58.517
What joy is left for me?

212
20:59.985 --> 21:03.055
If only I could know the pleasure of the flesh again.

213
21:03.922 --> 21:07.893
If one husband dies, I can just get a new one.

214
21:09.361 --> 21:11.897
But the nobles are fighting among themselves,

215
21:12.397 --> 21:15.634
while the men have all died in battle, leaving only women behind.

216
21:16.101 --> 21:17.102
What can we do?

217
21:18.170 --> 21:19.171
Your Majesty.

218
21:20.005 --> 21:24.009
There are no men left.

219
21:24.309 --> 21:26.979
How are we to stop the enemy now?

220
21:30.415 --> 21:34.286
Then I shall have to give you a son.

221
21:37.222 --> 21:38.290
What?

222
21:38.357 --> 21:39.625
I will give you a son too.

223
21:39.992 --> 21:42.127
No matter how many men die,

224
21:42.194 --> 21:46.832
I will keep giving you sons.

225
21:47.699 --> 21:49.034
Is this not an entertaining show?

226
21:52.838 --> 21:55.174
You are even more entertaining for inviting me to see it.

227
21:56.008 --> 21:59.278
Does this play not mock your grandfather, King Jinji?

228
22:00.279 --> 22:03.015
How could you invite us here?

229
22:03.081 --> 22:05.884
I will arrest those actors and ensure they never perform again.

230
22:06.285 --> 22:07.586
Why, those lunatics.

231
22:07.653 --> 22:08.821
How dare you!

232
22:10.556 --> 22:11.557
It is all right.

233
22:13.091 --> 22:16.228
The suffering people must have a place to vent their resentment.

234
22:16.862 --> 22:19.431
Are you so proud of your deposed grandfather?

235
22:20.499 --> 22:21.633
Of course not.

236
22:23.702 --> 22:26.972
However, seeing the play brought many things to mind.

237
22:28.807 --> 22:31.210
The men at the borders are killed by the enemy,

238
22:32.377 --> 22:35.981
and people in the capital are starving. That is our reality.

239
22:37.282 --> 22:40.285
We must be united to save the country.

240
22:42.688 --> 22:44.156
Otherwise, only ruin awaits us.

241
22:46.959 --> 22:48.994
Are you suggesting that we are causing a division?

242
22:50.495 --> 22:51.597
It is what you are doing.

243
22:53.031 --> 22:56.902
Bi Dam, have you ever seen a unanimous decision at the Hwabaek Council?

244
22:57.636 --> 23:03.075
Was not King Jinji dethroned unanimously?

245
23:03.642 --> 23:07.279
I mean a time when we were united for the sake of the country.

246
23:07.913 --> 23:11.583
You, Kim Chun Chu, are speaking of harmony?

247
23:12.684 --> 23:14.186
Even a passing dog would laugh.

248
23:15.787 --> 23:19.892
Blinded by desire for victory, you saw me surrounded by Baekje troops,

249
23:21.493 --> 23:24.329
yet you only cared about opening the gates.

250
23:36.608 --> 23:39.077
Chun Chu, help me.

251
24:12.844 --> 24:13.912
And because of that,

252
24:16.048 --> 24:17.983
I have been stuck...

253
24:18.717 --> 24:22.421
with this cane ever since!

254
24:29.695 --> 24:30.829
Bi Dam.

255
24:31.730 --> 24:34.566
Back then, Chun Chu had to do what he could to survive.

256
24:46.578 --> 24:49.047
I am sure you know it.

257
24:50.182 --> 24:52.384
You know the truth of that day.

258
25:12.671 --> 25:17.809
The fear and confusion you must have felt back then...

259
25:19.745 --> 25:20.846
I understand it well.

260
25:22.180 --> 25:23.248
Liar.

261
25:23.815 --> 25:26.184
Chun Chu, you are a man who knows no fear.

262
25:27.319 --> 25:28.887
Even when the head of your comrade was being cut off,

263
25:28.954 --> 25:30.589
you were probably thinking of your next move.

264
25:32.024 --> 25:34.259
No, you are wrong.

265
25:35.694 --> 25:39.531
I am afraid of my people dying and losing my country.

266
25:41.433 --> 25:43.335
As your former comrade, I am truly sorry...

267
25:44.703 --> 25:46.238
for the pain you feel.

268
25:47.272 --> 25:48.440
What did you say?

269
25:50.342 --> 25:52.077
If we fail to protect Daeyaseong now,

270
25:52.744 --> 25:55.013
The blade of Baekje will reach all the way to Seorabeol.

271
25:56.782 --> 25:58.216
I will go to Daeyaseong Fortress.

272
25:59.718 --> 26:04.489
If Kim Pum Seok is truly guilty, I intend to die there with my son.

273
26:13.298 --> 26:15.567
The true intentions of a man are always revealed in the end.

274
26:17.135 --> 26:20.005
So you are asking for more troops for Daeyaseong.

275
26:26.578 --> 26:30.048
Lord Bi Dam, give me 500 of your troops and 300 from Lord Jin Ju.

276
26:30.782 --> 26:33.685
I desperately need them.

277
26:34.886 --> 26:35.921
Please join forces with me.

278
26:37.289 --> 26:39.124
What about the threat from Goguryeo?

279
26:39.191 --> 26:41.793
How can you take the troops from Seorabeol as you please?

280
26:43.028 --> 26:44.062
You are mad.

281
26:46.064 --> 26:49.000
You may only care about Daeyaseong because your daughter is there,

282
26:49.801 --> 26:51.002
but Seorabeol is my priority.

283
26:52.437 --> 26:53.872
This is the capital of the nation.

284
26:54.840 --> 26:57.776
I am sure Her Majesty, who favors you, feels the same way.

285
27:05.750 --> 27:10.655
If you want them so badly, get on your knees.

286
27:12.924 --> 27:17.395
I need to see how desperate you are with my own eyes.

287
27:41.920 --> 27:43.021
Oh, dear.

288
27:43.121 --> 27:44.222
Goodness.

289
27:45.257 --> 27:46.424
How could he do it?

290
27:46.491 --> 27:47.859
Chun Chu, you are something else.

291
27:50.695 --> 27:53.165
- Oh, no. - Unbelievable.

292
27:58.603 --> 28:00.205
You are quite the actor.

293
28:02.140 --> 28:04.442
You are putting on the real play here.

294
28:31.970 --> 28:35.707
You look more sorrowful than your father on his knees.

295
28:37.075 --> 28:40.312
You have a long way to go to catch up to him.

296
29:13.311 --> 29:15.880
Tell me where the body was buried.

297
29:18.683 --> 29:19.784
Oh, that...

298
29:20.785 --> 29:24.723
Lord Chun Chu only took his most trustworthy servants with him.

299
29:30.128 --> 29:32.864
(Liaodong, Goguryeo, Year 642)

300
29:42.274 --> 29:43.375
Have you heard?

301
29:43.675 --> 29:46.845
His Majesty is tearing down the monument celebrating our victory over Sui.

302
29:47.112 --> 29:48.113
(Lord of Ansiseong Fortress)

303
29:48.179 --> 29:49.748
He is trying to avoid war with Tang.

304
29:49.848 --> 29:51.850
Should we not go and stop him right now?

305
29:52.217 --> 29:53.952
We must not leave the fortress.

306
29:55.153 --> 29:57.522
Protecting this place is our duty.

307
29:57.756 --> 29:58.857
But...

308
29:59.357 --> 30:00.458
Farewell.

309
30:14.072 --> 30:16.741
The monument and the shrines have all been demolished,

310
30:17.008 --> 30:20.245
and Qin Daede of Tang has arrived.

311
30:53.078 --> 30:55.580
(Ko Geon Mu, 27th ruler of Goguryeo)

312
31:10.662 --> 31:15.633
- You have destroyed it completely. - Is this not what you wanted?

313
31:15.700 --> 31:17.168
Since you have demolished...

314
31:17.235 --> 31:20.472
the war monument and shrines built after the victory over Sui,

315
31:20.872 --> 31:24.743
the people of Tang will now regard Goguryeo as an ally.

316
31:24.809 --> 31:25.844
(Ko Yeon Mu, Goguryeo's general)

317
31:26.878 --> 31:31.182
His Imperial Majesty will be extremely pleased.

318
31:32.717 --> 31:35.954
In return for your hospitality, I shall report favorably on my visit.

319
31:38.790 --> 31:40.158
All right.

320
32:10.755 --> 32:12.424
(Ko Hwan Gwon, Goguryeo's Crown Prince)

321
32:14.959 --> 32:16.861
Long live Yeon Gae So Mun!

322
32:16.928 --> 32:19.364
- Long live Yeon Gae So Mun! - Long live Yeon Gae So Mun!

323
32:19.531 --> 32:24.669
- Long live Yeon Gae So Mun! - Long live Yeon Gae So Mun!

324
32:25.003 --> 32:30.208
- Long live Yeon Gae So Mun! - Long live Yeon Gae So Mun!

325
32:30.608 --> 32:35.780
- Long live Yeon Gae So Mun! - Long live Yeon Gae So Mun!

326
32:37.182 --> 32:39.717
(Yeon Gae So Mun, Goguryeo Eastern Commander)

327
32:41.586 --> 32:43.855
(Geom Mo Jam, Goguryeo's general)

328
32:43.922 --> 32:44.989
(Mu Hyeok, Goguryeo's Eastern Army)

329
33:08.746 --> 33:09.881
It is delicious.

330
33:22.327 --> 33:23.428
Horses are approaching.

331
33:24.295 --> 33:25.396
Could it be?

332
33:26.698 --> 33:28.099
It cannot be.

333
33:28.166 --> 33:31.236
The Goguryeo king said we would be safe.

334
33:46.017 --> 33:50.088
Do not be afraid. Goguryeo cannot hurt us Tang soldiers.

335
35:14.072 --> 35:18.109
We have defeated Sui.

336
36:19.037 --> 36:23.408
(The Tang, destroyers of the monument, are enemies of Goguryeo.)

337
36:38.356 --> 36:43.928
Your Majesty, King Uija of Baekje has secretly sent the envoy Seong Chung.

338
36:46.464 --> 36:49.701
King Uija sent an envoy?

339
36:55.106 --> 36:59.644
He wants us to join Baekje and attack Silla together?

340
36:59.711 --> 37:01.112
That is correct, Your Majesty.

341
37:01.646 --> 37:02.647
(Seong Chung, Baekje's minister)

342
37:02.714 --> 37:06.784
Baekje is sweeping through Silla, having seized 40 of their fortresses.

343
37:07.585 --> 37:10.154
If you were to join forces with us,

344
37:11.255 --> 37:12.957
Silla will surely fall.

345
37:13.024 --> 37:17.528
If Baekje has the power to take 40 Silla fortresses on its own,

346
37:18.296 --> 37:21.733
why do you seek our help?

347
37:23.134 --> 37:26.037
The downfall of Silla is inevitable,

348
37:26.604 --> 37:29.273
but if Goguryeo and Baekje join forces,

349
37:29.340 --> 37:33.478
we can minimize sacrifices and bring Silla down much faster.

350
37:33.544 --> 37:35.046
So you mean to reduce losses of Baekje...

351
37:36.147 --> 37:39.016
at the cost of my country?

352
37:47.358 --> 37:50.795
Surely you know that a small sacrifice...

353
37:50.862 --> 37:54.098
can yield a great reward, Your Majesty?

354
37:54.899 --> 38:00.037
War is no small sacrifice.

355
38:01.806 --> 38:08.646
I have no intention of spilling the blood of my people for your greed.

356
38:09.213 --> 38:12.850
If you join us, it will surely benefit Goguryeo...

357
38:12.917 --> 38:15.019
I wish you a safe journey back.

358
38:24.896 --> 38:27.932
The head of a Tang official was hung in the marketplace.

359
38:28.065 --> 38:30.301
What? Who would do such a thing?

360
38:30.902 --> 38:32.470
Who else could it be?

361
38:33.371 --> 38:37.141
It is only a matter of time before the Tang hears of this.

362
38:43.314 --> 38:48.052
Order Yeon Gae So Mun to return to Pyongyangseong Fortress immediately.

363
38:49.554 --> 38:50.721
Yes, Your Majesty.

364
38:57.762 --> 39:00.665
His Majesty is far too lenient with Yeon Gae So Mun.

365
39:01.132 --> 39:04.969
He walks around as if he owns the place.

366
39:05.336 --> 39:10.308
Crown Prince, Yeon Gae So Mun will surely commit treason.

367
39:11.676 --> 39:15.213
I will see him beheaded.

368
40:14.705 --> 40:17.775
Time truly flies.

369
40:18.576 --> 40:22.346
It has already been two years since you became the Eastern Commander.

370
40:28.052 --> 40:31.122
I told you it would be best to discharge the veteran soldiers.

371
40:32.156 --> 40:33.724
Yet they remain,

372
40:35.593 --> 40:39.864
secretly comforting the people in your name.

373
40:40.631 --> 40:46.103
If you insist they must be disbanded, I shall do so immediately.

374
40:48.205 --> 40:51.976
Send the veterans back to their homes so they may retire in peace.

375
40:53.778 --> 40:57.949
Goguryeo has been at war for far too long.

376
40:58.449 --> 41:02.119
To those men who have grown old in these arduous wars,

377
41:03.087 --> 41:06.190
I wish to grant them the gift of rest.

378
41:06.991 --> 41:08.893
I shall do as you command.

379
41:12.430 --> 41:14.332
And another thing.

380
41:15.232 --> 41:19.570
Why does your Eastern Army continue to grow?

381
41:20.805 --> 41:24.375
Rather than having those loyal soldiers lose their lives in a war with Tang...

382
41:24.942 --> 41:29.213
and leave their wives widowed...

383
41:29.280 --> 41:32.650
and their children mourning,

384
41:33.718 --> 41:37.955
would it not be better to maintain peace with the Tang?

385
41:43.828 --> 41:49.400
Right now, I am in need of a subject who will offer me honest advice.

386
41:56.140 --> 42:01.045
Your Majesty, you are the monarch who defeated the Sui Dynasty.

387
42:01.112 --> 42:04.849
How can you bow your head so easily now?

388
42:06.384 --> 42:09.587
You know that those who unify the Central Plains...

389
42:09.653 --> 42:12.256
always invade their neighboring nations.

390
42:13.424 --> 42:17.395
The conquered are left in misery, starving and destitute,

391
42:18.162 --> 42:23.734
but the victor becomes a hero, living in luxury with the spoils of war.

392
42:25.169 --> 42:28.572
The only thing left for that thief to take...

393
42:30.408 --> 42:32.710
is Goguryeo, Your Majesty.

394
42:32.777 --> 42:34.211
That is why we seek peace.

395
42:35.913 --> 42:37.848
It is to avoid giving them a pretext for war...

396
42:38.949 --> 42:41.919
and to allow our impoverished people to recover.

397
42:43.320 --> 42:46.991
Though we defeated Sui, all that was left...

398
42:48.159 --> 42:52.163
was a ruined land and a starving populace.

399
42:54.899 --> 42:56.000
Wait.

400
42:57.535 --> 43:00.438
Our time will come.

401
43:00.504 --> 43:02.873
Across the border, an army stands ready.

402
43:02.940 --> 43:07.178
It is a massive force, eager to invade.

403
43:07.244 --> 43:09.046
We must suppress that urge.

404
43:09.113 --> 43:11.816
Did I not say we are seeking peace?

405
43:11.882 --> 43:15.719
How can those seeking peace destroy war monuments...

406
43:17.388 --> 43:21.125
and send spies disguised as envoys to map our terrain?

407
43:22.026 --> 43:26.097
They are deceiving Your Majesty and will surely invade.

408
43:27.565 --> 43:29.033
Peace is an illusion.

409
43:29.633 --> 43:32.436
Strike them instead of seeking peace, Your Majesty.

410
43:33.170 --> 43:37.708
Use the same strategy you used during the war against Sui.

411
43:38.409 --> 43:42.446
Strike Yingzhou first to provoke them.

412
43:45.616 --> 43:47.618
Do you think Li Shimin is a fool...

413
43:49.220 --> 43:51.222
who would fall for the same tactic?

414
43:52.723 --> 43:55.526
Li Shimin has fought hundreds of battles.

415
43:55.593 --> 43:59.063
Do you not know he is a born strategist who has never lost?

416
43:59.130 --> 44:02.900
You, too, are an undefeated hero of this kingdom.

417
44:03.968 --> 44:05.136
You are our hero.

418
44:25.156 --> 44:31.395
Once, there was a leopard who thought he was king of the forest.

419
44:31.462 --> 44:36.433
He strutted about, commanding the entire woods.

420
44:37.701 --> 44:40.938
But one day,

421
44:44.208 --> 44:51.148
he came face-to-face with a tiger and was utterly terrified.

422
44:51.215 --> 44:53.150
He had never dreamed that...

423
44:54.285 --> 44:59.957
something so much larger and more fearsome than himself could exist in this world.

424
45:13.571 --> 45:16.073
So that leopard began to dream.

425
45:17.341 --> 45:22.446
He told himself, "I am a tiger. I must become a real tiger."

426
45:23.314 --> 45:28.986
He honed his skills, enduring pain and hardship...

427
45:30.187 --> 45:31.922
until he finally became a real tiger.

428
45:32.690 --> 45:36.327
No, he became a beast so fierce...

429
45:38.395 --> 45:42.967
that even the tiger trembled in fear.

430
46:04.688 --> 46:08.259
So are you saying the leopard became a tiger?

431
46:16.667 --> 46:18.002
By having a dream?

432
46:21.639 --> 46:22.740
In truth,

433
46:23.874 --> 46:28.078
that leopard was a tiger from the start, Your Majesty.

434
46:28.145 --> 46:32.049
He simply had not realized it.

435
46:38.989 --> 46:43.294
That is Goguryeo, and at its center...

436
46:45.129 --> 46:46.664
is you, Your Majesty.

437
46:58.909 --> 47:05.082
I had my worries, but seeing your sincerity today,

438
47:06.617 --> 47:08.185
I feel greatly reassured.

439
47:11.822 --> 47:16.427
I would like you to take charge of Liaodong.

440
47:18.829 --> 47:23.267
Go there and oversee the construction of Cheollijangseong.

441
47:24.368 --> 47:28.405
And prepare to attack Yingzhou.

442
47:35.846 --> 47:36.947
I shall...

443
47:39.616 --> 47:41.085
obey your command.

444
47:42.786 --> 47:48.826
Time is of the essence. Go to Liaodong after the ceremony.

445
47:51.095 --> 47:52.529
Complete this great task.

446
48:23.026 --> 48:24.328
What is it that you want?

447
48:25.496 --> 48:28.665
A peaceful world? Or a beautiful one?

448
48:31.268 --> 48:34.638
In Mun, must I want something from life?

449
48:37.174 --> 48:39.610
I am asking whether you intend to help Father.

450
48:41.378 --> 48:44.281
The Jingol nobles only care about their own interests.

451
48:44.348 --> 48:46.784
Father is fighting a lonely battle against them.

452
48:46.850 --> 48:49.186
Do you not have the slightest desire to understand him?

453
48:50.988 --> 48:52.556
Should we not help Father...

454
48:52.623 --> 48:54.892
and gather the strength to overcome this crisis?

455
48:59.196 --> 49:03.066
Answer me. Everyone is doing their best, but you...

456
49:11.341 --> 49:13.644
- You go to Tang. - What?

457
49:15.712 --> 49:17.014
I am going to Daeyaseong.

458
49:18.415 --> 49:20.451
Are you going to defy the wishes of our father again?

459
49:22.419 --> 49:23.687
Absolutely not.

460
49:24.321 --> 49:25.923
I must go save Go Ta So,

461
49:26.723 --> 49:29.393
who was forced into a political marriage in my stead...

462
49:31.528 --> 49:33.063
and now lives in the dangerous Daeyaseong.

463
49:52.449 --> 49:56.286
Your Majesty, how can you send a dangerous man like Yeon Gae So Mun...

464
49:56.353 --> 49:59.389
to Liaodong, where he will be beyond your control?

465
50:00.958 --> 50:06.230
If you give the order, I will eliminate him immediately...

466
50:07.764 --> 50:09.433
to remove the source of trouble.

467
50:25.282 --> 50:29.920
Yeon Gae So Mun will never set foot in Liaodong.

468
50:35.359 --> 50:38.529
His Eastern Army will leave for Liaodong first.

469
50:39.329 --> 50:45.002
Once he leaves Pyongyangseong after the ceremony without his army,

470
50:47.704 --> 50:49.940
that is when I will kill him.

471
50:55.546 --> 50:57.381
He will die beyond the walls of Pyongyangseong,

472
50:58.148 --> 50:59.750
so as not to plunge the people into turmoil.

473
51:02.719 --> 51:07.858
The ambushing troops will destroy the key leaders of the Eastern Army.

474
51:09.359 --> 51:11.461
I finally understand your plan, Your Majesty.

475
51:13.897 --> 51:15.399
I will follow your command with my life.

476
51:19.202 --> 51:23.106
With this great sword, I defeated...

477
51:23.173 --> 51:27.778
tens of thousands of Sui soldiers with only 500 men.

478
51:29.446 --> 51:33.317
It has protected Goguryeo and me all my life.

479
51:37.154 --> 51:39.356
I shall bestow this sword upon you.

480
51:41.224 --> 51:44.928
You must protect Goguryeo with it.

481
52:12.489 --> 52:18.795
I swear on this sword that I will fulfill my mission.

482
52:23.000 --> 52:25.469
(Sasu, North of Pyongyangseong Fortress)

483
52:26.903 --> 52:29.306
(Song of the Eastern Army, "Goguryeo Yields to No One")

484
52:29.606 --> 52:36.613
(The great waters of the river turn red)

485
52:37.547 --> 52:44.554
(The ironclad fortress stands against the northern wind)

486
52:45.622 --> 52:52.629
(The glory left by our ancestors now rests in our hands)

487
52:53.697 --> 52:56.033
(Ko Jeong Eui, Central Commander, Goguryeo)

488
52:56.099 --> 53:00.937
(Goguryeo yields to no one)

489
53:02.839 --> 53:03.940
Come on.

490
53:20.357 --> 53:22.359
(Goguryeo)

491
53:37.541 --> 53:39.576
(Great Goguryeo)

492
53:43.313 --> 53:44.414
What should we do?

493
53:47.451 --> 53:48.618
Let them through.

494
54:01.364 --> 54:02.566
Let us have a drink.

495
54:07.270 --> 54:09.239
I look forward to working with you.

496
54:10.140 --> 54:12.375
Over here, Gae So Mun.

497
54:15.378 --> 54:16.580
Say hello.

498
54:19.282 --> 54:21.418
I am General Yeon Nam Saeng of Goguryeo.

499
54:25.088 --> 54:28.492
Liaodong will be very cold. Have you made your preparations?

500
54:28.625 --> 54:30.827
My heart is cold because I am leaving you all,

501
54:30.894 --> 54:32.596
but my body is warm enough.

502
54:34.030 --> 54:38.502
If you hold out a little while, I will come to relieve you soon.

503
54:38.568 --> 54:42.139
Please do so. You must not forget.

504
54:46.409 --> 54:52.415
His Majesty the King and the Crown Prince are entering!

505
55:29.920 --> 55:30.987
You may begin.

506
55:31.721 --> 55:32.789
Yes, Your Majesty.

507
57:25.201 --> 57:26.503
Confiscate his sword!

508
57:39.215 --> 57:40.317
Cease!

509
59:04.467 --> 59:06.269
(Forest near Seorabeol)

510
59:11.708 --> 59:17.714
O great King of Gipa, Immortal Boy of the Snowy Mountain.

511
59:17.781 --> 59:22.719
The era of the sick and heirless queen is coming to an end!

512
59:23.820 --> 59:29.826
Now, let the Jingol nobles here, who carry the pure blood of Silla,

513
59:29.893 --> 59:32.195
succeed to the throne!

514
59:33.963 --> 59:37.934
The incompetent Queen put Silla in peril!

515
59:38.535 --> 59:42.205
Punish her nephew, Kim Chun Chu.

516
59:42.939 --> 59:46.943
Show them that...

517
59:47.010 --> 59:53.249
only the pure Jingol nobles can protect Silla!

518
59:55.151 --> 59:58.755
Here is a loyal general!

519
59:59.589 --> 01:00:04.127
We offer the soul of Baek Ryong.

520
01:00:09.599 --> 01:00:11.000
Take the ropes.

521
01:00:21.845 --> 01:00:23.012
King Jinpyeong...

522
01:00:23.980 --> 01:00:29.052
monopolized the throne by claiming only his bloodline was royal!

523
01:00:29.119 --> 01:00:32.188
He dreamed of having a son who would embody Maitreya,

524
01:00:32.922 --> 01:00:36.025
but when no son came, he cunningly made his daughter the ruler!

525
01:00:38.862 --> 01:00:43.299
King Jinheung first tainted the blood of our country...

526
01:00:43.366 --> 01:00:46.569
by accepting Kim Yu Sin and his family into the Jingol rank.

527
01:00:47.837 --> 01:00:49.873
Kim Chun Chu is colluding with Kim Yu Sin...

528
01:00:50.974 --> 01:00:53.576
to cast us aside and take the throne for himself.

529
01:00:59.482 --> 01:01:01.151
Is there anyone who will back out?

530
01:01:02.285 --> 01:01:03.486
- No one. - No one.

531
01:01:07.857 --> 01:01:10.026
Bring all the remaining Jingol nobles to our side.

532
01:01:11.327 --> 01:01:14.531
We must push Queen Seondeok into a corner...

533
01:01:14.597 --> 01:01:16.966
and make her side with me, not Kim Chun Chu.

534
01:01:17.500 --> 01:01:18.635
- We agree. - We agree.

535
01:01:29.712 --> 01:01:31.614
Vīrya Balena!

536
01:01:32.148 --> 01:01:37.320
Āyu Sara Sara...

537
01:01:39.189 --> 01:01:45.361
Bodhi Bodhi, Buddhya Buddhya!

538
01:01:45.428 --> 01:01:50.700
Huru Huru! Svaha!

539
01:02:07.717 --> 01:02:11.955
- We beg you to remove Kim Chun Chu. - We beg you to remove Kim Chun Chu.

540
01:02:12.855 --> 01:02:16.726
- We beg you to remove Kim Chun Chu. - We beg you to remove Kim Chun Chu.

541
01:02:18.027 --> 01:02:21.931
- We beg you to remove Kim Chun Chu. - We beg you to remove Kim Chun Chu.

542
01:02:22.398 --> 01:02:24.567
Lord Chun Chu, I have a question for you.

543
01:02:24.901 --> 01:02:27.604
I heard that General Baek Ryong of Sokhamseong Fortress...

544
01:02:27.670 --> 01:02:29.973
went to your house while he was seriously injured.

545
01:02:31.674 --> 01:02:33.576
This is a grave matter.

546
01:02:34.711 --> 01:02:37.447
Why did you not report this to Her Majesty immediately?

547
01:02:42.952 --> 01:02:45.555
It is true that General Baek Ryong came to my house.

548
01:02:46.189 --> 01:02:49.325
But with Baekje mounting such a fierce offensive,

549
01:02:49.726 --> 01:02:54.130
I only acted with caution to prevent further chaos.

550
01:02:54.197 --> 01:02:56.266
You say you acted with caution?

551
01:02:57.233 --> 01:03:00.470
While rumors of treachery by the Gaya people are spreading,

552
01:03:00.536 --> 01:03:05.875
did you not think your silence would cause more turmoil?

553
01:03:12.715 --> 01:03:13.816
This is...

554
01:03:15.585 --> 01:03:18.388
the helmet General Baek Ryong wore.

555
01:03:24.594 --> 01:03:29.132
It was found in a coffin buried by your own servants.

556
01:03:36.039 --> 01:03:37.740
You killed General Baek Ryong.

557
01:03:49.986 --> 01:03:53.823
His hatred for the Gaya people led him...

558
01:03:54.791 --> 01:03:58.428
to accuse them without proof and sow discord.

559
01:04:00.129 --> 01:04:02.165
And he failed to protect his own fortress.

560
01:04:02.231 --> 01:04:03.933
Is that why you killed him?

561
01:04:17.847 --> 01:04:18.948
I...

562
01:04:30.226 --> 01:04:31.794
Behead him!

563
01:04:32.328 --> 01:04:35.331
- Behead Kim Chun Chu! - Behead Kim Chun Chu!

564
01:04:42.372 --> 01:04:46.476
- We beg you to remove Kim Chun Chu. - We beg you to remove Kim Chun Chu.

565
01:04:47.143 --> 01:04:49.879
- We beg you to remove... - We beg you to remove...

566
01:04:59.389 --> 01:05:05.561
Your Majesty, any more hesitation will only plunge Silla into further chaos.

567
01:05:06.996 --> 01:05:10.666
Dismiss Kim Chun Chu and behead him!

568
01:05:11.234 --> 01:05:15.738
- Behead Kim Chun Chu! - Behead Kim Chun Chu!

569
01:05:15.805 --> 01:05:22.812
- Behead Kim Chun Chu! - Behead Kim Chun Chu!

570
01:05:24.547 --> 01:05:29.452
- Behead Kim Chun Chu! - Behead Kim Chun Chu!

571
01:05:29.519 --> 01:05:32.021
General Kim Yu Sin has arrived.

572
01:06:14.263 --> 01:06:16.933
(Kim Yu Sin, Silla's Supreme General)

573
01:06:31.747 --> 01:06:34.917
Now leave. Be gone.

574
01:06:34.984 --> 01:06:40.790
Your Majesty, may I say a few words before I leave?

575
01:06:43.726 --> 01:06:44.827
Father.

576
01:06:53.002 --> 01:06:54.003
Oh, dear.

577
01:07:02.311 --> 01:07:03.412
Firstly,

578
01:07:04.447 --> 01:07:07.817
since so many of you are cheering on my departure,

579
01:07:08.618 --> 01:07:10.686
while I am grateful,

580
01:07:10.753 --> 01:07:14.090
I also feel like I am being driven out.

581
01:07:21.631 --> 01:07:24.033
Now, hush.

582
01:07:27.470 --> 01:07:28.571
Silence.

583
01:07:30.473 --> 01:07:31.574
Attention!

584
01:07:39.148 --> 01:07:40.316
I, Yeon Gae So Mun,

585
01:07:42.018 --> 01:07:46.255
have thought long and hard about what is best...

586
01:07:47.390 --> 01:07:49.458
for the people of Goguryeo.

587
01:07:50.459 --> 01:07:51.594
And I have...

588
01:07:54.897 --> 01:07:56.732
come to a conclusion.

589
01:08:02.138 --> 01:08:04.807
To the people who gave their lives to protect this land,

590
01:08:04.874 --> 01:08:06.208
the Goguryeo of today...

591
01:08:07.677 --> 01:08:08.678
is a disgrace.

592
01:08:12.748 --> 01:08:14.283
An absolute disgrace!

593
01:08:19.956 --> 01:08:25.995
Goguryeo shall never yield to anyone.

594
01:09:03.866 --> 01:09:06.702
As long as I live,

595
01:09:08.638 --> 01:09:11.874
no one shall ever...

596
01:09:17.847 --> 01:09:20.516
invade Goguryeo!

597
01:09:45.474 --> 01:09:47.643
It is a rebellion!

598
01:10:19.341 --> 01:10:21.877
(Sword & Silence)

599
01:10:22.745 --> 01:10:24.814
(Thanks to Cho Seong Ha for his special appearance.)
